{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of the ultimate wheeler-dealer, master of quick fixes and king of car lot hustle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run your own used car lot on the edge of nowhere. Buy for pennies, sell for dollars, and let smooth talk and carefully retouched photos seal the deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hunt for bargains</strong><br>Scour junkyards, talk to shady characters, and hunt for cars with \u201cpersonality.\u201d Every ride has a story (and probably a few hidden problems).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/13cebd5013f6f5d6c8576273dbb9fd36.poster.avif?t=1773908359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/13cebd5013f6f5d6c8576273dbb9fd36.webm?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/13cebd5013f6f5d6c8576273dbb9fd36.mp4?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Make it look \u2018like new\u2019</strong><br>Putty, hammer, spray paint\u2014done! Looks good\u2026 well, from certain angles. Turn wrecks into \u201cmiracles of engineering\u201d\u2014or at least make them look great in photos.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/91f07685b2d133b41d2ffa1cccf0068d.poster.avif?t=1773908359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/91f07685b2d133b41d2ffa1cccf0068d.webm?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/91f07685b2d133b41d2ffa1cccf0068d.mp4?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac <strong>\u201cWho needs AC? Just roll down the window!\u201d</strong><br>Haggle like a pro: pick your dialogue lines, slide that price bar, and drop unforgettable one-liners like:<br><i>\u201cKnock off a little and I\u2019ll be back in an hour with my </i>cousin<i>.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Take the Perfect Pic, Edit the Hell Out of It</strong><br>Use your magical laptop to turn trash into treasure. A little filter here, a little retouch there... and voila \u2013 showroom-ready deception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/c75a5a035c9c581eaf6ff25f7addc840.poster.avif?t=1773908359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/c75a5a035c9c581eaf6ff25f7addc840.webm?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/c75a5a035c9c581eaf6ff25f7addc840.mp4?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Your own lot in an open world</strong><br>Expand your lot, unlock new features like car washes or miracle tuning shops, and make your mark in the world of Totally Legit Business\u2122.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/72f34c08f68b13aa2cc0f8e7f4f31674.poster.avif?t=1773908359\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/72f34c08f68b13aa2cc0f8e7f4f31674.webm?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/extras/72f34c08f68b13aa2cc0f8e7f4f31674.mp4?t=1773908359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc08 <strong>Bonus: The Ginger Cat</strong><br>He\u2019s watching. Always. And yes \u2013 it\u2019s <i>the same cat every time</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally Legit Wheeler Dealer mixes humor, hustling, and a love for sketchy car deals into one wild package. A little sanding, a little spray paint, and boom\u2014it\u2019s good enough to sell.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875690?t=1773908359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875690?t=1773908359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/824311acdfbcaf739fbc89fcad18a8e56abb9bd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773908359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875690/824311acdfbcaf739fbc89fcad18a8e56abb9bd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773908359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of the ultimate wheeler-dealer, master of quick fixes and king of car lot hustle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run your own used car lot on the edge of nowhere. Buy for pennies, sell for dollars, and let smooth talk and carefully retouched photos seal the deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Hunt for bargains</strong><br>Scour junkyards, talk to shady characters, and hunt for cars with \u201cpersonality.\u201d Every ride 